{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>辛苦咗大半年，如果想同另一半或者班friend食餐好慰勞下自己，不如去歎頂級和牛啦！由日本全農直送嘅「和牛燒肉‧純」，由即日起至2027年1月17日推出全新「A Taste of Uruguay」美酒佳餚企劃。唔單止有極高質嘅日本和牛燒肉套餐，仲可以無限暢飲3款精選烏拉圭紅白酒，食、飲都勁滿足！即睇有咩必食推介。</p>\n<h2>日本全農直送 歎盡多個頂級和牛部位</h2>\n<p>作為香港首屈一指嘅專售日本和牛元祖級餐廳，「和牛燒肉‧純」嘅和牛全部由日本全國農業協同組合聯合會直接供貨，保證食到正宗日本極致風味。今次呢個套餐每位收費港幣$1,200（另設10%服務費），由前菜到甜品都極具誠意。打頭陣有清爽嘅豆腐沙律、雜錦泡菜同兩款刺身；跟住就到燒肉重頭戲，一次過歎勻厚切牛舌、特選和牛牛排肉、上等和牛牛排肉、風味濃郁嘅日式壺漬牛排肉，仲有肉質細緻嘅和牛西冷！最後食埋香氣四溢嘅和牛炒飯、是日餐湯同甜品，真係捧住個肚走呀。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.25.36_2707397896afada4c13bf3-1024x665.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"燒肉 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.25.36_2707397896afada4c13bf3-1024x665.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.26.14_19863146946afada7903c46-1024x696.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"燒肉 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"653\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.26.14_19863146946afada7903c46-1024x696.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>南美佳釀絕配 烏拉圭紅白酒無限暢飲</h2>\n<p>食高質燒肉點少得靚酒？今次企劃最特別之處，係由香港日本文化協會理事福田惠子推介嘅跨文化配搭，將日本和牛配上烏拉圭名莊 Bodega Mederos 同 Aichi Uruguay S.A. 嘅靚酒。套餐包咗3款紅白酒無限暢飲，首先有清新果香同礦物感嘅 Albariño 2026 白酒，配刺身同前菜勁夾。</p>\n<p>食燒肉時，就可以轉飲烏拉圭國寶級葡萄品種 Tannat 釀造嘅紅酒，佢嘅豐厚單寧同酸度可以完美化解和牛嘅油脂感，仲可以提升肉質鮮甜。必飲帶有烏拉圭日裔移民加藤先生親筆題字「絆」嘅 Kizuna Tannat 2025，口感絲滑，同日式料理完美契合；仲有經過12個月橡木桶陳釀嘅 Tannat Reserva 2024，配西冷同壺漬牛排肉簡直係絕配。除咗任飲嗰3款，現場仲有另外3款紅酒可以單點添。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.25.47_25222406afadaa558840-1024x709.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"燒肉 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"665\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.25.47_25222406afadaa558840-1024x709.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.28.29_11014810716afadadbc183e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"燒肉 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"481\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-16-6.28.29_11014810716afadadbc183e.png\" width=\"375\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>和牛燒肉‧純</h3>\n<p>尖沙咀店: 尖沙咀東部加連威老道96號 希爾頓大廈1樓3號鋪</p>\n<p>電話:<a>2723 3868</a></p>\n<p>銅鑼灣店: 銅鑼灣邊寧頓街8號 HDH 亨利集團中心7樓</p>\n<p>電話:<a>2807 0103</a>\n</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:08.996377+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1094,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:32:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:51.473465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:45.003105+00:00","content_hash":"1d9a3c9d432838224665c08ce5b632e02513768ab6c0eeb2255dcacab3aabf81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}